<title>UK: Guatemala sets $150 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Guatemala sets $150 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guatemela has launched a $150 million 10-year bond which will be priced later today, lead manager BankBoston said on Monday.  </p>
<p>BankBoston later said the bond would be priced to yield 240-250 basis points over U.S. Treasury notes.</p>
